male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1610625006:1":{"text":"ニールの取り調べは、彼が回復してからでも――","source_cn":"我们应该等尼尔彻底康复以后再……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA5C80FA6D80D9F62","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1610625007:1":{"text":"いいえ、今すぐ取り調べる必要があります。ドルシェさん、あなた方だって一刻も早く生徒たちの疑いを晴らしたいでしょう？","source_cn":"不，必须现在。杜瑞拉女士，校方应该希望他能尽快洗清嫌疑吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0A6AAD068DD9C402","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1610625008:1":{"text":"それはもちろん、ですがやはり……あら？<style=\"highlight\">ノックの音</style>？","source_cn":"洗清嫌疑当然是必要的，但我还是认为……嗯？谁在<sty...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0122C0CF6F3BED17","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1610625009:0":{"text":"お話中失礼いたします、イフリー様。貴族事務官から<style=\"highlight\">グレムの取り調べ報告書</style>が届きました。","source_cn":"打扰了，伊芙大人，这份是贵族事务官提交的<style=...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8284FC6C22ECF5C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1610625010:1":{"text":"あら、グレムの報告書ざますね。まずはこれから見てみましょう。","source_cn":"啊，格墨文的报告，我们应该先看看这个……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x80016234E842616B","variant_status